Z||000003||RobertVol||11-27-2000||06:37 PM||||Hey guys !!! I am back from the DEAD!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Seriously I have been out of town on business and then just got back from Thanksgiving Holidays Stuff. Sorry to be disappearing. Also I have had some trouble with the GT ....Complete Distributor setup and EGR replacement. and manifold issues. Man when the car goes down it goes down!! <P>About 900 dollars worth !!! OUCH. (wish I had time to do it myself) but I am back from the dead and alive in the fiero world. I will be speaking to Olsen about the meeting next month and maybe more info on further meetings! Talk to you all soon!!!! <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A>||||reg||1
Z||000004||PearlBlueSoul||11-28-2000||06:12 AM||||Hey!  hehe, you guys just missed the ATL MR2's run up to Deal's gap/the Dragon in October!  man that was a blast.  all those curves!  hehe<P>Does anyone here go out to Barett Parkway very often?  I was wondering if a couple of you guys would want to get together with a couple of us and hang out, peruse the parking lots, cruise, whatever.  It'd be cool to see a lineup like that.  <P>Do you guys ever show your Fieros?  Can't say I've seen any fieros, much less MR2s at car shows.  <P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR><A HREF="http://"http://www.atlantamr2s.com"" TARGET=_blank>www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://"http://www.geocities.com/darionscard"" TARGET=_blank>Pics of my car, "Heaven and Hell"</A><BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">    <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.<P>[This message has been edited by PearlBlueSoul (edited 11-28-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by PearlBlueSoul (edited 11-28-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Shaun41178||11-28-2000||09:54 AM||||hey robert, I am in Daytona Beach.  We should meet up sometime.  I am down here for a while and I am loking to talk to some Fiero people.  Seeing as you are only about an hours away it could be good.  Oh yea and something has to be done about 95 with that construction.  I was driving through there 2 days ago and a stone flew up and chiped my windshield and has started to spiderweb a bit.  I should make Jacksonvillians pay for my damage.  If you need any more Fiero work done let me know.  I am pretty familiar with the workings of them.  I could save you a few bucks too.||||reg||1
